    "name": "Plan B",
    "steam_appid": 3792730,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/5cff653111c5736502965c6a56441652.avif?t=1752505915\" width=800 height=182 /></span><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You roll into the chaotic, low-poly city of <strong>New Raxon</strong> with nothing but a beat-up van and a contact number. Your mission? Deliver high-risk, illegal cargo for cartels, corrupt politicians, crime lords, and underground media networks\u2014all while dodging cops, planning the fastest routes, and building your black-market empire with your crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <strong>Plan B</strong>\u2014a wild physics-based TPS/FPS co-op simulator where every delivery is a gamble\u2026 and every dollar is dirty.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/9aa727ca1590f7622488dd1ec0d11d2c.avif?t=1752505915\" width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From cartel shipments to sensitive political files, every job is shady. Use stealth or speed to drop the package and disappear before the heat catches up.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/3e47728cc3cf97e1fba752a6ee48f635.avif?t=1752505915\" width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect roadblocks, undercover cops, drones, and sabotage from rival gangs. One wrong turn and it\u2019s a full-blown citywide pursuit.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/682830e7d057126bdfec5d6dedefc0cc.avif?t=1752505915\" width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with 3 friends and take on contracts together.Stack missions, plan diversions, and pull off deliveries like a real crew.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/4f2103aad3f12941310624f746dba1a2.avif?t=1752505915\" width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second counts. Use your GPS, street instincts, and city knowledge to avoid heat and hit deadlines. The fastest way isn't always the safest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/15f35fd35b30908b840524841da89a9e.avif?t=1752505915\" width=800 height=234 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every crate, vehicle, and collision is physics-driven. Deliveries can fall, flip, or explode\u2014your skills decide whether it's a clean drop-off or total disaster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/c7ff573c3ec2e63d683de65f3ae0201e.avif?t=1752505915\" width=800 height=234 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small. Work your way up. Buy stash houses, upgrade vehicles, hire fixers, and unlock secret delivery tech to automate your underground empire.<br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan B</strong> isn\u2019t just about crime\u2014it\u2019s about control.</p><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/5cff653111c5736502965c6a56441652.avif?t=1752505915\" width=800 height=182 /></span><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You roll into the chaotic, low-poly city of <strong>New Raxon</strong> with nothing but a beat-up van and a contact number. Your mission? Deliver high-risk, illegal cargo for cartels, corrupt politicians, crime lords, and underground media networks\u2014all while dodging cops, planning the fastest routes, and building your black-market empire with your crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <strong>Plan B</strong>\u2014a wild physics-based TPS/FPS co-op simulator where every delivery is a gamble\u2026 and every dollar is dirty.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/9aa727ca1590f7622488dd1ec0d11d2c.avif?t=1752505915\" width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From cartel shipments to sensitive political files, every job is shady. Use stealth or speed to drop the package and disappear before the heat catches up.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/3e47728cc3cf97e1fba752a6ee48f635.avif?t=1752505915\" width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect roadblocks, undercover cops, drones, and sabotage from rival gangs. One wrong turn and it\u2019s a full-blown citywide pursuit.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/682830e7d057126bdfec5d6dedefc0cc.avif?t=1752505915\" width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with 3 friends and take on contracts together.Stack missions, plan diversions, and pull off deliveries like a real crew.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/4f2103aad3f12941310624f746dba1a2.avif?t=1752505915\" width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second counts. Use your GPS, street instincts, and city knowledge to avoid heat and hit deadlines. The fastest way isn't always the safest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/15f35fd35b30908b840524841da89a9e.avif?t=1752505915\" width=800 height=234 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every crate, vehicle, and collision is physics-driven. Deliveries can fall, flip, or explode\u2014your skills decide whether it's a clean drop-off or total disaster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792730/extras/c7ff573c3ec2e63d683de65f3ae0201e.avif?t=1752505915\" width=800 height=234 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small. Work your way up. Buy stash houses, upgrade vehicles, hire fixers, and unlock secret delivery tech to automate your underground empire.<br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan B</strong> isn\u2019t just about crime\u2014it\u2019s about control.</p><br>",
    "short_description": "From a desperate runner to a ruthless kingpin \u2014 smuggle drugs, weapons, and secrets through a corrupt city. Outsmart police, sabotage rivals, and build your empire with warehouses, vehicles, and loyal crew. Every delivery is a risk; every decision shapes your rise to power.",
